    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜として: as (in the role of)",
     "texto": [
      "To say someone's role or position: **せんせい として、 にほんご を おしえて います** (as a teacher, I teach Japanese).",
      "What follows is the role, not the person."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜としたら: if it were; supposing that",
     "texto": [
      "To imagine something: **もし にほん へ いく としたら、 なに を します か** (if you went to Japan, what would you do?).",
      "It's used a lot to ask hypothetical questions."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜に違いありません: surely; for sure",
     "texto": [
      "To be almost sure of something: **あした は あめ に ちがいありません** (it will surely rain tomorrow).",
      "It's more certain than 〜でしょう."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
